<title>EGYPT: SOCCER-ZAMALEK OF EGYPT BEAT MUFULIRA OF ZAMBIA 5-2.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZAMALEK OF EGYPT BEAT MUFULIRA OF ZAMBIA 5-2.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zamalek of Egypt beat Mufulira</p>
<p>Wanderers of Zambia 5-2 (halftime 1-2) on Friday in their first</p>
<p>leg match in the second round of the African Champions Cup.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Zamalek: Khaled Ghandour 5, Sami Shishini 53, Ayman Mansour</p>
<p>54, Tarek Moustafa 71, Ahmad El-Kas 88.</p>
<p>Mufulira: Martin Shulla 22, Milton Bionda 33</p>
</text>
